Changes made by amauta: package-lock.json and all examples except web-app.architecture.json
and production-deployment.architecture.json were left out; the update check was disabled for good
(bin/delivery-update.mjs resolves "disabled" without starting a child process, and
scripts/check-update.mjs updatesDisabled() returns true), so the skill never touches the network.
Everything else is as upstream published it. Checksums are in assets/manifest.json.

